        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 1180px;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #666;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .spread {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      aspect-ratio: 3308 / 2252;\n      padding: 3.25% 4.78% 2.45%;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .topbar {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #858585;\n      font-size: clamp(10px, 0.79vw, 26px);\n      font-weight: 300;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .report-name {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .navigation {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 1.28vw;\n    }\n\n    .navigation span {\n      display: inline-block;\n    }\n\n    .navigation .active {\n      padding: 0.12em 0.48em 0.16em;\n      color: #008fd3;\n      border: 1.5px solid #008fd3;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 5.05% 0 2.05%;\n      color: #008fd3;\n      font-size: clamp(24px, 1.72vw, 57px);\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .legend-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      margin: -0.77% 0 1.33%;\n    }\n\n    .legend {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.94vw;\n      height: clamp(28px, 1.62vw, 54px);\n      padding: 0 1.05vw;\n      background: #f1f1f1;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      color: #555;\n      font-size: clamp(11px, 0.79vw, 26px);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .legend-label sup {\n      position: relative;\n      top: -0.12em;\n      margin-left: 0.08em;\n      font-size: 55%;\n    }\n\n    .legend-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.38vw;\n    }\n\n    .columns {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 9.5%;\n    }\n\n    .column {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-rows: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      row-gap: clamp(10px, 1.42vw, 32px);\n    }\n\n    .risk-row {\n      position: relative;\n      display: grid;\n      min-height: clamp(49px, 3.09vw, 102px);\n      border: 1.35px solid #0098dc;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .left-column .risk-row {\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 16.5%;\n      border-radius: 999px 0 0 999px;\n      border-right: 0;\n    }\n\n    .right-column .risk-row {\n      grid-template-columns: 16.5% minmax(0, 1fr);\n      border-radius: 0 999px 999px 0;\n      border-left: 0;\n    }\n\n    .description {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-width: 0;\n      font-size: clamp(11px, 0.84vw, 28px);\n      line-height: 1.52;\n      font-weight: 300;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .left-column .description {\n      padding: 0.28em 1.55em 0.28em 3.62em;\n    }\n\n    .right-column .description {\n      padding: 0.28em 3.62em 0.28em 1.25em;\n    }\n\n    .topic {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0.35em 0.9em;\n      background: #0796d2;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: clamp(11px, 0.86vw, 29px);\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .period {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 50%;\n      width: clamp(18px, 1.27vw, 42px);\n      height: clamp(18px, 1.27vw, 42px);\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\n      border: clamp(2px, 0.15vw, 5px) solid var(--ring);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #fff;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .left-column .period {\n      left: clamp(9px, 0.66vw, 22px);\n    }\n\n    .right-column .period {\n      right: clamp(9px, 0.66vw, 22px);\n    }\n\n    .period::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 21%;\n      left: 48%;\n      width: 18%;\n      height: 40%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--hand);\n    }\n\n    .period::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 49%;\n      left: 27%;\n      width: 34%;\n      height: 18%;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--hand);\n    }\n\n    .short {\n      --ring: #ffe0d2;\n      --hand: #ff7442;\n    }\n\n    .medium {\n      --ring: #d8d8d8;\n      --hand: #8e8e8e;\n    }\n\n    .long {\n      --ring: #adeccd;\n      --hand: #00b96b;\n    }\n\n    .footer-note {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 54.75%;\n      bottom: 3.65%;\n      width: 34.8%;\n      padding-top: 0.45%;\n      border-top: 2px solid #0796d2;\n      color: #747474;\n      font-size: clamp(8px, 0.53vw, 18px);\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      font-weight: 300;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 3.55%;\n      color: #222;\n      font-size: clamp(11px, 0.72vw, 24px);\n      font-weight: 300;\n    }\n\n    .page-number.left {\n      left: 4.8%;\n    }\n\n    .page-number.right {\n      right: 4.8%;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-aspect-ratio: 3308/2252) {\n      .spread {\n        min-height: auto;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"spread\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\">\n      <div class=\"report-name\">2024 · 美的集团ESG报告</div>\n      <nav class=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"报告章节\">\n        <span>关于本报告</span>\n        <span>走进美的</span>\n        <span>可持续发展治理</span>\n        <span>守护蓝色星球</span>\n        <span>构建和谐社区</span>\n        <span>践行科技尽善</span>\n        <span>共创繁荣生态</span>\n        <span class=\"active\">附录</span>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <h1>附录二 可持续发展相关风险和机遇</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"legend-row\">\n      <div class=\"legend\">\n        <span class=\"legend-label\">时间周期<sup>24</sup>：</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-item\"><i class=\"period short\" style=\"position:relative;top:auto;left:auto;right:auto;transform:none;\"></i>短期</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-item\"><i class=\"period medium\" style=\"position:relative;top:auto;left:auto;right:auto;transform:none;\"></i>中期</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-item\"><i class=\"period long\" style=\"position:relative;top:auto;left:auto;right:auto;transform:none;\"></i>长期</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"columns\">\n      <div class=\"column left-column\">\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应建立完善的环保管理体系，加强环境监测和评估，确保生产活动符合相关标准和法规要求，从而降低环境风险和运营成本。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">环境<br>合规管理</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应尊重员工权益，提供平等的工作机会和福利待遇，建立包容性的企业文化，通过吸引和留住来自不同背景的人才，增强创新能力。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">员工权益与<br>多元化</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period medium\" aria-label=\"中期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应建立完善的网络安全防护体系，加强数据管理和监控，确保客户数据的安全和隐私。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">数据安全与<br>客户隐私保护</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应加强对供应链中冲突矿产的监控和管理，确保采购的矿产来自合法和可持续的来源，避免出现相关事件的负面声誉与财务影响。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">冲突<br>矿产管理</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period medium\" aria-label=\"中期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应加强对水资源的管理和监控，采用节水技术和工艺，并通过推动水资源循环利用和节水文化建设，降低水资源消耗、污染和利用成本。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">可持续<br>水资源管理</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应建立健全的反腐败机制，加强员工教育和培训，确保经营活动的合规性和透明度。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">反商业贿赂及<br>反贪污</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业在推广产品或服务时，必须遵循真实、准确、透明的原则，避免夸大其词或误导消费者，从而确保企业正面形象。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">负责任营销与<br>宣传</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">高效利用能源不仅可以降低企业的运营成本，提高生产效率，还有助于减少对环境的影响。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">能源利用</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period medium\" aria-label=\"中期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应坚决抵制虚假宣传、恶意降价、商业贿赂等不正当竞争行为，通过合法合规的经营方式，树立行业标杆，推动整个行业的健康发展。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">反不当竞争</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应严格遵守环保法规，加强污染治理，减少污染物排放，保护生态环境。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">污染物排放</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应积极参与社会公益活动，通过捐赠资金、物资、技术支持等方式回馈社会，帮助弱势群体，促进社会和谐稳定。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">社会贡献</div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应强化知识产权保护，维护合法权益，同时尊重他人知识产权，通过完善管理制度激发创新活力，助力技术进步与产业升级。</div>\n          <div class=\"topic\">知识产权保障</div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"column right-column\">\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">应对气候变化</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">随着全球气候变化的日益严峻，企业可通过采用可再生能源、提高能源利用效率、推广绿色产品和服务等方式，积极应对并减缓气候变化的影响。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">创新与研发</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">通过不断探索新技术、新产品和新服务，企业可以保持竞争优势，满足消费者不断变化的需求。同时，研发投资也可能带来财务投入和潜在风险。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">产品质量与<br>安全</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">确保产品符合标准法规，是企业保护消费者的底线。企业需完善质量管理体系，强化检测监控，保障产品质量稳定。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">供应链管理与<br>安全</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">有效的供应链管理可以降低生产成本，供应链的稳定性和可靠性可以防范潜在的风险和中断，企业需要加强供应商管理。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">员工健康与<br>安全</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应提供安全的工作环境，加强员工健康管理和培训，确保员工免受伤害。健康的员工队伍可以提高工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">循环经济与<br>废弃物管理</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业循环利用资源、减少废弃物产生并妥善处置，既能降低环境负担、提升资源利用效率，又能借循环经济与绿色生产模式开拓新商机与市场空间。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">公司治理</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应完善治理结构与内控机制，保障决策科学透明合规。深化与股东、投资者及利益相关者的沟通协作，夯实信任基础，提升企业形象声誉。</div>\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">员工培训与<br>发展</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">通过提供培训和发展机会，企业可以激发员工潜能，提升其工作效率和生产力，为企业创造更多价值。</div>\n          <i class=\"period medium\" aria-label=\"中期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">消费者体验</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应关注消费者需求，不断精进产品和服务，满足消费者不断变化的需求，提升品牌形象和市场份额。</div>\n          <i class=\"period short\" aria-label=\"短期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">股东权益</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应确保股东利益得到充分保障，通过建立良好的治理结构、透明的信息披露和合理的股利分配机制，深化股东沟通合作，提升投资者信心。</div>\n          <i class=\"period medium\" aria-label=\"中期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">促进行业发展</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应积极参与行业交流与合作，通过分享经验、整合资源、协同合作等方式，共同推动技术创新和产业升级，实现互利共赢。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"risk-row\">\n          <div class=\"topic\">生物多样性<br>保护</div>\n          <div class=\"description\">企业应积极采取措施，保护生态环境和生物多样性，避免对生态系统造成破坏。</div>\n          <i class=\"period long\" aria-label=\"长期\"></i>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-note\"><sup>24</sup> 结合美的集团所处行业、公司的战略规划和运营实际，我们的短中长期定义为：短期（0-1年）；中期（1-5年）；长期（5年以上）。</div>\n    <div class=\"page-number left\">141</div>\n    <div class=\"page-number right\">142</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      "finish_reason": "stop"
    }
